COMMENT ON TABLE AB_ACCRECORDS IS '票据流水表';
COMMENT ON COLUMN AB_ACCRECORDS.ID IS '票据流水表id';
COMMENT ON COLUMN AB_ACCRECORDS.VID IS '票据主表ID';
COMMENT ON COLUMN AB_ACCRECORDS.VVID IS '票据从表id';
COMMENT ON COLUMN AB_ACCRECORDS.RECID IS '票据签收表id';
COMMENT ON COLUMN AB_ACCRECORDS.TRID IS '票据划拨表ID';
COMMENT ON COLUMN AB_ACCRECORDS.LASTID IS '上一流水ID';
COMMENT ON COLUMN AB_ACCRECORDS.LASTBILLCODE IS '上一票据状态代码';
COMMENT ON COLUMN AB_ACCRECORDS.VALID_SIGN IS '处理标志：0未完成；1可用；2已结束';
COMMENT ON COLUMN AB_ACCRECORDS.IS_HIDE IS '是否隐藏1是0否';
COMMENT ON COLUMN AB_ACCRECORDS.STATUS IS '审批处理状态：-2已删除；-1打回；0 暂存；10提交；11-94审批中；95 已完成；96已拆包';
COMMENT ON COLUMN AB_ACCRECORDS.OPT_STATUS IS '操作状态：15待复核；16待发送；17已发送待回应；18已回应待签收；19已签收成功业务完成；-1发送失败；-2打回；-3撤回；-4拒签';
COMMENT ON COLUMN AB_ACCRECORDS.SEND_SIGN IS '是否发送指令标志：0否； 1是 ；';
COMMENT ON COLUMN AB_ACCRECORDS.BILL_SOURCE IS '票据来源：10收票登记11背书登记12质押登记14贴现登记15归集收入16上划收入17下拨收入';
COMMENT ON COLUMN AB_ACCRECORDS.RETURN_CODE IS '返回代码';
COMMENT ON COLUMN AB_ACCRECORDS.BRIEF_ID IS '业务类型';
COMMENT ON COLUMN AB_ACCRECORDS.INSIDE_SING IS '内部业务标志：0  否；1 是';
COMMENT ON COLUMN AB_ACCRECORDS.ENTER_STOCK_NEW IS '所属库存:10单位库存11中心代管12银行托管';
COMMENT ON COLUMN AB_ACCRECORDS.ENTER_STOCK_OLD IS '所属库存:10单位库存11中心代管12银行托管';
COMMENT ON COLUMN AB_ACCRECORDS.BAIL_TYPE IS '保证类型:01开票保证，02承兑保证；03背书保证';
COMMENT ON COLUMN AB_ACCRECORDS.RECALL_TYPE IS '撤回类型';
COMMENT ON COLUMN AB_ACCRECORDS.BANKENDRSMTMK IS '不得转让标记：EM00 可再转让；EM01 不得转让';
COMMENT ON COLUMN AB_ACCRECORDS.STTLMMK IS '清算方式：SM00 开启线上清算、SM01 关闭线上清算';
COMMENT ON COLUMN AB_ACCRECORDS.APPLY_DATE IS '申请日期';
COMMENT ON COLUMN AB_ACCRECORDS.BUSINESS_DATE IS '业务归属日期';
COMMENT ON COLUMN AB_ACCRECORDS.RCRSOKMONEY IS '追索同意清偿金额';
COMMENT ON COLUMN AB_ACCRECORDS.CN_ACCRECORDS IS '前手';
COMMENT ON COLUMN AB_ACCRECORDS.SIGN_UP_FLAG IS 'SU00-同意  SU01-拒绝';
COMMENT ON COLUMN AB_ACCRECORDS.ABS IS '摘要（补录并入库时会判断此 storage 来确定是否入库）';
COMMENT ON COLUMN AB_ACCRECORDS.RMK IS '备注';
COMMENT ON COLUMN AB_ACCRECORDS.CREDIT_CODE IS '授信代码(多个授信用;分开)';
COMMENT ON COLUMN AB_ACCRECORDS.BUDGET_CODE IS '预算科目(多个科目用;分开)';
