COMMENT ON COLUMN AB_ACCRECORDS.EMIT_STTLMMK IS '应付票据兑付方式：0或空线下兑付1线上兑付';
COMMENT ON COLUMN AB_ACCRECORDS.CREATE_NAME IS '创建人名称';
COMMENT ON COLUMN AB_ACCRECORDS.CREATE_BY IS '创建人登录名称';
COMMENT ON COLUMN AB_ACCRECORDS.CREATE_DATE IS '创建日期';
